message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "OpenCloudModel Resources"
abstract: "An open dataset that maps cloud resource concepts to the Terraform resource types and attributes of AWS, Azure and Google Cloud under vendor-neutral names. Each placement carries its source and a match grade, and the whole mapping is built by hand under a published protocol."
authors:
